---
title: Template Upload Pipeline
---
flowchart TD
    A([User uploads DOCX or PDF]) --> B[detectDocumentFormat\nmagic bytes check]
    B --> C[FileParser.parseTemplate]

    C --> D{Format?}
    D -->|PDF| E[PDFBox PDFTextStripper\nextract raw text]
    D -->|DOCX| F[forEachParagraph\nparagraph.getText joined by newline]

    E --> G[PlaceholderProcessor.normalize\nCRLF to LF\nUnicode dots to ASCII dots]
    F --> G

    G --> H[PlaceholderProcessor.findPlaceholders\nregex: 4 or more consecutive dots\ncount occurrences = N]

    H --> I{Was PDF?}
    I -->|Yes| J[FileUtils.convert\nPDF to DOCX via LibreOffice headless]
    I -->|No| K[Use original DOCX bytes]

    J --> L[DocxNormalizer.normalizePlaceholdersInDocx\nMERGE runs per paragraph\nSUBSTITUTE all dots to exactly 4 dots\nWRITEBACK to runs preserving formatting]
    K --> L

    L --> M[FileUtils.compress\nGZIP the normalized DOCX]

    M --> N[(documentRepository.save\nDocumentTemplate entity\ndocumentContent = compressed DOCX\nfieldCount = N\ndocumentFormat = DOCX always\nisFullyMapped = false)]

    N --> O[templateFieldRepository.saveAll\nfor position 0 to N-1:\nTemplateField with fieldPosition and null label]

    O --> P[PlaceholderProcessor.substituteEach\nReplace each placeholder with field ID markers\nfor UI field-position display]

    P --> Q([Return TemplateUploadResponseDTO\ntemplateName, templateId\ndocumentText with field markers])

    style A fill:#4A90D9,color:#fff
    style Q fill:#27AE60,color:#fff
    style N fill:#8E44AD,color:#fff
